OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after crash involving car
OL,4,Aand HGV                                
OL,6,FA 33-year-old man has died after a     
OL,7,Fcrash involving a car and an HGV on the
OL,8,FM180 in North Lincolnshire.            
OL,10,FHumberside Police said it received     
OL,11,Freports that a grey Ford Fiesta, which 
OL,12,Fwas travelling westbound between       
OL,13,Fjunctions 3 and 2 at about 12:00 GMT on
OL,14,FThursday, had been involved in a       
OL,15,Fcollision with a red HGV.              
OL,17,FThe road was closed and the man, who   
OL,18,Fwas the driver of the Fiesta, was      
OL,19,Fpronounced dead at the scene.          
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
